  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "d274545edb2d76f5cedf6b188252fa6d90e755e33d5136b6711596728790ee33",
      "text": "有下列任一情形的，可以在原处分标准二分之一的范围内减轻停止业务处分。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00026",
      "source_hash": "88e856b3b90e4602f72c7164622b2a3b4bd3bcf78c3d7da0fc9a22879f532943",
      "text": "但属于法第三十六条第一款第三项或第四项的，不得减轻。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "474a13a9236c94201152c9a16b464c60368d3b640e1a7bd22636a8b368190f95",
      "text": "1）认定违法行为系因轻微疏忽或者错误造成的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00029",
      "source_hash": "e1d7f15fdf919f32a67dbaac7d011776fbb9ab8f1b292c81f53c64ae916d3ebc",
      "text": "2）违法行为内容及程度轻微，所造成的损害较小的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00030",
      "source_hash": "8a94056faeee08bc3a4b70461e1836e118d973a2bd1fd6f8f450dac77d3b3423",
      "text": "3）认定违法者已为纠正或者消除违法状态而作出努力的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "e366814d4287af1b8b841620197dcac3e19e622ef692112ed2a40a1de031b809",
      "text": "情形。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00032",
      "source_hash": "b8977f39513f3e0458a404e8d4961c0b6b56a4a19f685d86a9af49714ceedabe",
      "text": "4）其他考虑违法行为的程度、动机及后果等，认为有必要缩短停止业务"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "15bad4f5e3b41f16c6e0f5bbd952c8ab827a579117259dc086d4cc87030f880b",
      "text": "期间的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "1d6f6bce78138ea58d3cc062dbce45c849d57266d25052a404c84318174a0c95",
      "text": "2. 个别标准"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00035",
      "source_hash": "903aa577eae3314c52694d8cb0c32f8a688802c384b7267385dc97b9afdad866",
      "text": "违法行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "d7794cf130b736a7916042cc14e3a797206fad2daf25ed41a53aacbb091b1bea",
      "text": "依据"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "7481a8625685b3cd78acbf5af0a02559bd4607dc88baed3f11b8a9e33aef882d",
      "text": "行政处分标准"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "532b0a8da32810e919895f72bdc1ed7b7800d66b47796273db7ab8199922e316",
      "text": "法律条文"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "ac189b9e31e9838a8787fe8abff8ba8c3814870d10b0614331e1c1ec6057b415",
      "text": "第一次违法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "314bcec12380f24803e2bfa65febfcfa6fe1a7f86b41c9c618bcf6b34456277c",
      "text": "第二次违法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "162b4dc2dfcda432cf18b6d958b0aaaa8f1d2214c04369366c04271d95f8cda3",
      "text": "第三次违法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "d7f8451dabc92c39a44920ab74231c808f5b75b04ab242673f5754331f134fb0",
      "text": "第四次违法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "1d5df887c56912a8169bbd2c8a8e81b5539165c27de5fc11c1f12ead970cd993",
      "text": "甲. 通过虚假或者其他不正当"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00044",
      "source_hash": "a1bd7706b6f89bb57ce541d1f30ca881f920c6f0961f4bda3c323be3093175a6",
      "text": "撤销指定"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "4688b74e541043ead843ad1b2f0085362cc05db4cc617c89f438a0af95a4b5c9",
      "text": "方式取得指定的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "5198fda504aaab07c3eb72d5924603b0d00f9c160e6469b32df089fc8e507eae",
      "text": "法第三十六条第一款"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "57b5987e7319edde8155347fa1f58b08caa454086a07ad01b45a54bceadba267",
      "text": "第一项"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00048",
      "source_hash": "3d94c35fd089a10b8744c0218d7c0e9e1aab6759744eb73d15d7852432866027",
      "text": "乙. 不符合依据法第三十三条第六款规定的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00049",
      "source_hash": "6c0f751064e5a1ca0e18ed5bd87d83ec200d1443ed3df1bf540916b904aa8d23",
      "text": "警告"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00050",
      "source_hash": "097b2e2eb36d514eb13b29c18105fa6085756f34e77993ece81a28eb6510cd93",
      "text": "停止业务"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Verified Annex 5 concession conditions and first rows of individual administrative punishment table against Korean source. Corrected stop-business suspension reduction conditions, citations, table labels and START-corrupted designation criterion, maintaining existing numbered cells."
